    "headline": "BX Infra is a non-traded fund that owns stakes in long-lived infrastructure: transportation, digital and energy assets. It aims to keep at least 80% of its NAV in infrastructure investments and up to 20% in debt and other securities. Eligible investors subscribe monthly. The fund expects to redeem up to 3% of its units outstanding each quarter in total. Units held under two years pay a 5% early redemption deduction, and the general partner can modify or suspend the plan.",
